    { "id": "obs-009", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T22:30:00Z", "channel": "telegram", "content": "Worked late to close out the sprint properly. I don't like leaving things half-done when there's an obvious finish line." },
    { "id": "obs-010", "timestamp": "2026-04-02T10:02:00Z", "channel": "telegram", "content": "I usually read the full documentation before writing any code. Some people think it's slow. I think it's cheaper than the alternative." },
    { "id": "obs-011", "timestamp": "2026-04-02T15:30:00Z", "channel": "telegram", "content": "Had a disagreement with a colleague about approach. Explained my reasoning clearly. They didn't change their mind. I moved on." },
    { "id": "obs-012", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T09:17:00Z", "channel": "telegram", "content": "Three months from now I want this system running cleanly and without me thinking about it. I'm working backward from that." },
